            <p class="sub">No percentage discounts, no hidden add-ons, and no feature tier restrictions.</p>
            <div class="plans">
                <div class="plan"><div class="plan-top"><h3>Starter</h3><span class="tag">Free up to 50 students</span></div><div class="price">₦0 <small>/ term</small></div><p>Perfect for small schools getting started with EduCore.</p></div>
                <div class="plan"><div class="plan-top"><h3>Standard</h3><span class="tag gold">₦300 per student / term</span></div><div class="price">All features</div><p>Every paid school gets the full EduCore platform.</p></div>
